# hint would no longer name its menu item (Shader, Advanced), Artwork, which
# also covers screenshots and fan art, and the handheld-content shader notes.
# Two final periods and one "ё" the update dropped are restored, the comma
# it added before "или" is not, and "Turn on Save Before Power Off first"
# follows that setting's new name.
# Hide and delete strings by LVD14 (GitHub, Jawaka#212), 2026-10-13, with
# edits by Atanvaron (GitHub, Jawaka#212), 2026-10-13, taken except that
# "пресет" stays, as in RetroArch's own Russian menus; Show/Hide stays an
# action; Storage free stays "Свободно"; unhiding reads "показать", as on
# the Unhide button; and the file counts keep LVD14's "Карта: %s" form,
# with one placeholder fewer in "1 file". Three typos are fixed.
# Resume notices by Atanvaron (GitHub, Jawaka#212), 2026-10-14, which fit
# now that a long notice wraps onto two lines; Removed reads "Удалено", as
# LVD14 agreed.
